  "body": "## What changed\n`crates/app/tests/wire_stamp.rs`: the `WireContourOp` literal in `wire_op` now sets `taper_deg: 0.0`, the field #1163 added. Test-only; no product code.\n\n## How tested\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --no-run` on this branch: every test binary compiles (exit 0).\n- Pinning: `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test wire_stamp` - 3 passed.\n\n## Not exercised\nClippy and the wider suites were not run (test-only one-field change).\n\nChangelog: none\n\nEffort: low\n\nFixes #1377\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
